  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">戰鬥與死亡 | F.A.D</span></strong></h1>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>《戰鬥與死亡》是一款 Roguelike PvE 地圖。</strong></span></h3>\n<hr>\n<h3><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lz0S7tHkAcQ\" width=\"768\" height=\"431\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br></h3>\n<hr>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_33b8323b-10b5-4d5a-bc5e-5adba411c169.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"842\" height=\"596\"></h1>\n<hr>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e15c59c6-3674-4ac9-943e-64e2a9b909a3.png\" alt=\"\"></h1>\n<hr>\n<h3><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7be858b4-bd6f-4b61-a148-68bc1ebdedee.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"843\" height=\"596\"><br><br></h3>\n<hr>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><em>該地圖通常會隨著相依模組自動下載。<br><br>由於玩家數量限制，建議直接使用「開放至區域網路」來遊玩。<br><br>F.A.D 目前仍處於測試版，因此您可能會遇到一些問題。<br></em></span></h3>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><em><br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffightanddeath\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1603700/description_60870ca6-1b74-4e91-9041-ac1a1905a1b5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"211\" height=\"289\"></a><br></em></span></h3>",
